<< /A 41 0 R /Alt (Flowchart graphic with three columns: Evidence provenance lists ovarian longitudinal biological evidence, direct ovarian AI evidence, and transferred methodological evidence. Temporal evidence class \(T0\205T3\) details T0 static, T1 serial summaries, T2 explicit time-aware, and T3 decision-linked. Translation gates outline five steps: intended use, minimum data, validation and calibration, action threshold and net benefit, and prospective impact and monitoring. A note at the bottom emphasizes that repeated data and complexity do not establish longitudinal validity or clinical benefit.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 25 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
